{"id":"en_burning-love","title":"Burning Love","titleEn":"Burning Love","description":"Sold by her gambling father as a child despite Jiang Yingqiu's frantic attempts to stop him, Lu Nanyan grew up far from her origins. Jiang's fury over the loss drove her to stab her husband, and she then reinvented herself, rising from housewife to a formidable businesswoman who built her own enterprise from nothing. Using that wealth and influence, she searched without pause for her missing daughter. Lu Nanyan, meanwhile, was sold repeatedly before finding refuge with a cleaner named Zhang Mei. Her childhood memories gone, she kept a half jade pendant, which became the key to Jiang Yingqiu's reunion with her biological daughter.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/burning-love/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/burning-love/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Revenge","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":true,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/u4pczv0.v774fmu/","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_burning-love_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/u4pczv0.v774fmu/","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_burning-love_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/u4pczv0.v774fmu/","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_burning-love_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/u4pczv0.v774fmu/","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_burning-love_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/u4pczv0.v774fmu/","kind":"embed","download